    "chunk_text": "Winds will be southwesterly. Wind speed will be (30-40) kmph. Wind speed can increase up to (50-60) kmph at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Hambantota to Pottuvil and from Mullaittivu to Puttalam via Kankasanthurai and Mannar.\n\nThe sea areas off the coasts extending from Hambantota to Pottuvil and from Mullaittivu to Puttalam via Kankasanthurai and Mannar will be rough at times. The other sea areas around the island will be moderate.\n\nTemporarily strong gusty winds and very rough seas can be expected during thundershowers.\n\nPage 2 of 2\n\nArabian Sea Weather: 05N - 15N, 65E-80E : Showers or thundershowers at most places. EQ - 05N, 65E-80E : Showers or thundershowers at several places. Other sea areas : Showers or thundershowers at a few places. Winds: EQ-10N, 75E-80E : South-westerly / (30-40) kmph; Gusting up to 50 kmph. 05N-20N, 60E-75E : Westerly to South-westerly / (30-40) kmph; Gusting up to 50 kmph. Other sea areas : North-westerly or Variable / (25-35) kmph. State of the Sea: EQ-10N, 75E-80E : Moderate, fairly rough at times. 05N-20N, 60E-75E : Moderate, fairly rough at times. Other sea areas : Slight to Moderate.\n\nSouth Indian Ocean:\n\nWeather: EQ-05S, 90E-100E : Showers or thundershowers at most places. EQ-10S, 60E-75E : Showers or thundershowers at several places. Other sea areas : Showers or thundershowers at a few places. Winds: 05S-10S, 65E-90E : South-easterly / (30-40) kmph. EQ-05S, 60E-85E : South-easterly or variable / (25-35) kmph Other sea areas : South-easterly or variable / (20-30) kmph.\n\nState of the Sea: 05S-10S, 65E-90E : Fairly rough. EQ-05S, 60E-85E : Moderate to fairly rough. Other sea areas : Slight to Moderate. **Temporary strong gusty winds and rough seas can be expected during thundershowers."
